# Sambac Clair V2 — 30 mL — Basket 1–17 Mixing Card

**CURRENT STOCK-CORRECTED FORMULATION DRAFT — NOT SKIN-RELEASED — CLEAN DRYDOWN NOT TESTED.**

Romandolide is depleted and is not used. This card is the basket-order view of [the complete V2 formula and diagnostic](Jasmine_Sambac_Clair_30mL_V2.md). It does not instruct you to modify an already compounded V1 bottle.

Work through Basket 1 to 17. Within each basket, transfer highest to lowest raw µL; ties use material-name order. Each row is added to the same blend, not prepared as a separate basket premix. Empty baskets remain visible and are skipped. This operational order does not establish odor or safety performance.

All rows other than Jasmine Sambac use the undiluted bottle form implied by this worktree inventory. Verify bottle labels before use; no silent dilution or grade substitution. Jasmine Sambac is the absolute stock **10% w/w in DPG**, not the Blossoms base or FO. Regular Hedione only, not HC.

