## Vehicle — outside the numbered baskets

- For the full recipe: ethanol 96% **q.s. to 30.00 mL final volume**, about 24 mL; do not assume volume additivity.
- For the one-fifth pilot: ethanol 96% **q.s. to 6.00 mL final volume**, about 4.8 mL. Minimum ingredient transfer is 12 µL.
- The supplied-stock loading is nominally 20% by recipe volume, not 20% neat aromatic material or 20% w/w.
- No extra DPG is added: it is already in the Sambac stock. Its exact carried mass depends on the transferred stock mass, not a v/v reinterpretation.

