## Accounting and release boundary

Each raw transfer remains convertible to ppm w/w through measured stock masses, or volume x stock density x active mass fraction. Exact stock densities are not established here. The master formula labels its uniform-density ppm estimates and retains the ODT/OAV diagnostics and their limitations; no exact ppm or neat-volume equivalent is inferred from the 10% w/w label alone.

For an eventual bench trial, use suitable calibrated equipment and handling protection, ventilation and ignition control. Mix gently after each basket and inspect for haze, crystals or separation. Do not apply unreleased concentrate or this draft to skin. A 6 mL blotter pilot can assess the design at 5, 30, 120 and 240 minutes; absence of an unpleasant indolic drydown is not yet demonstrated.

Basket source: the live `D:/chatbots/perfume-chem/docs/basket_order_preference.md` and existing numbered studio cards, read 2026-09-08. The explicit Always-used list governs Benzyl Benzoate and Hexyl Salicylate. This formatting change preserves every V2 dose and dilution. No purchase or physical preparation was performed.
